// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_SG_IP_Mission_1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2388787700" "We've just learned that a villain from the Rogue Isles is about to attack Independence Port on a mission of mayhem and bank robbery, aided by members of the Family. The City needs her defenders to <A HREF={ACCEPT}>get over the Independence Port and protect the city and the bank from those villains!</A> We have seen a live video feed of the bank, and it is under attack as we speak, so you should head over there quick. You probably have about 5 minutes or less before they make their escape. <br><br><color orange>This is a Safeguard mission. Once you prevent the heist, you will have 15 minutes to explore the area and potentially earn extra rewards before the P.P.D. lock down the area. You can earn extra time by defeating vandals and completing side missions, however you can lose time if they destroy too much of the city.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P1923270264" "Protect the Independence Port bank"
// SendOffString :
"P179467903" "We know that the villain is working with the Family for this mission, but we've also learned that the Council is planning to take to the streets themselves to take advantage of the situation. While your main objective is going to be the villain and the members of the Family, stopping any bad guys will be less of a burden for the P.P.D. reinforcements.<br><br><color orange>Periodically, vandals will arrive to destroy parts of the city. You will see a message when they arrive, and their locations will be displayed in your minimap.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2156707933" "Protect Independence Port bank"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3214528614" "Go protect Independence Port!"
// DeclineString :
"P737905035" "Sorry, can't help you this time."
// DeclineSendOffString :
"P3311727586" "What?! I understand, {HeroName}. You no doubt have some very important things to do. We'll do our best to stop them, but it doesn't look good."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2645960372" "You've reached Independence Port just as the attack began. Go find the members of the Family that are causing the mayhem and trying to rob the bank. Teach them a lesson they won't forget!"

